  "card": "This pull request configures functional test node startup and sync helpers to automatically wait for background index synchronization, resolving intermittent test flakes caused by race conditions. It addresses issue #36564 where wallet rescans failed due to block filters lagging behind the chain tip. Redundant manual index sync logic across 18 test files is removed, with no changes to production node code.",
